# Architecture

- Local-first: prefer on-device file APIs and client-side processing.
- Heavy work (image decode, render, imposition, later AVIF encode) MUST run in Web Workers (`createImageBitmap`, OffscreenCanvas) — never block the main thread.
- Keep domain logic in pure functions under `src/` testable without DOM when possible.
- Organize features as `src/<capability>/` (pure domain + worker + thin UI); avoid growing god components — prefer composition.
- 60 fps: zero LoAF entries in interaction scenarios; hot handlers p95 ≤ 2 ms; INP ≤ 100 ms (`src/perf/budgets.ts`).
